  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_6">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_6/1"/>See, I have no one atoning for me,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_6/2"/>no one to serve for me;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_6/3"/>the priest, garbed in white, is no longer,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_6/4"/>nor is the High Priest, adorned in glory,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_6/5"/>nor is there an obligatory, sin-offering,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_6/6"/>nor free-will and vow-offering;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_6/7"/>so You will atone for me,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_6/8"/>examiner of kidney and chamber.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_6/9"/>Close the breaches of Your sheep
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_6/10"/>and make space for the flock.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_6/11"/>Build them a fence
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_6/12"/>on that side and one on this.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_6/13"/>This sign will take place tomorrow.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
